  <p class="kk-dear">Hey,</p>
  <p>If you'd rather run it yourself than hire us, this is the page for you.</p>
  <p>Most ads go to everybody. Most cold email goes to a list somebody bought three years ago. Most "lead gen" is spaghetti at the wall.</p>
  <p>Demand Intelligence is the tool we built so our own team would stop guessing. It's what's behind every client result on this site. And now you can use it without us.</p>
  <h2>WHAT IT DOES</h2>
  <ul class="kk-list">
    <li><strong>Finds the people already looking.</strong> You tell it the topics people look up before they buy from you, and the area. It gives you the list of people in your market who looked in the last two to seven days, with contact details about 95% accurate.</li>
